    "detailed_description": "<strong>Saido</strong> is a modern browser for game modes and servers. Using Saido you can quickly find a community you really like, using powerful search and flexible filters, as well as connect to any game server directly from the application client.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2>auto-generated server playlists, new game modes and recently added servers on the Browse page.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search </h2>for servers that match your needs using the rich filters on the Search page.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collections</h2>of game servers created specifically for you to find a server with the right vibe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich filters </h2>Find the community that resonates with your interests using awesome filters available on almost every page.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Server page</h2>with detailed description, statistics and community center (available in a few next releases).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No fake servers </h2>There will be no fake servers in Saido.",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Saido</strong> is a modern browser for game modes and servers. Using Saido you can quickly find a community you really like, using powerful search and flexible filters, as well as connect to any game server directly from the application client.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2>auto-generated server playlists, new game modes and recently added servers on the Browse page.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Search </h2>for servers that match your needs using the rich filters on the Search page.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collections</h2>of game servers created specifically for you to find a server with the right vibe.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rich filters </h2>Find the community that resonates with your interests using awesome filters available on almost every page.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Server page</h2>with detailed description, statistics and community center (available in a few next releases).<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No fake servers </h2>There will be no fake servers in Saido.",
